      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STRATTON DRIVE (3) showed good early burn but run over late to finish 5th at Cannington in OPEN company. The form out of last race has been strong. Should be very hard to beat this time. FOOT FALCON (5) is in sizzling form lately, rocketing around Mandurah in 27.41 to score two back then following on with a 27.89 win over 488m at Mandurah. In form and looks a leading player again. SPOTLESS WAYNE (1) produced a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 509m behind RUPEE'S SPECIAL (30.27) in a Grade 4/5. Was a winner prior to that. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from five starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. INCREDIBLE HEART (2) can feature with the right run.",
